  <PropertyGroup>
    <Title>Lombiq Email Client for Orchard Core - UI Test Extensions</Title>
    <Copyright>Copyright © 2025, Lombiq Technologies Ltd.</Copyright>
    <Description>Lombiq Email Client for Orchard Core - UI Test Extensions: Extension methods that test various features in Lombiq Email Client for Orchard Core. See the project website for detailed documentation.</Description>
